---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Promotional Products Ecommerce Solutions | Swishtag";
const description = "Shopify commerce, company stores and workflow automation for promotional products distributors, suppliers and decorators.";
const canonical = "https://cms.swishtag.com/industries/";
const robots = "index,follow";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/generic-page.css" />
  <main><section class="gp-hero"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-kicker">Industries</div><h1>Built around how promotional products businesses actually operate.</h1><p>Different parts of the promotional products supply chain have different bottlenecks. Swishtag focuses on the commerce and operational layer around distributors, suppliers and decorators.</p><div class="gp-actions"><a class="gp-btn primary" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="gp-btn secondary" href="/solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-section-head"><h2>Start with the bottleneck that costs the team the most time.</h2><p>A distributor’s company-store problem is different from a decorator’s production problem. The architecture should reflect that.</p></div><div class="gp-grid"><article aria-label="Open Promotional Products Distributors" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/industries/promotional-products-distributors/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>DISTRIBUTORS</small><h3>Promotional Products Distributors</h3><p>Build company stores, connect product data and reduce repeated order administration.</p><a href="/industries/promotional-products-distributors/">Distributor solutions →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Promotional Products Suppliers" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/industries/promotional-products-suppliers/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>SUPPLIERS</small><h3>Promotional Products Suppliers</h3><p>Create cleaner product-data and order connections for the channels that need them.</p><a href="/industries/promotional-products-suppliers/">Supplier solutions →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Promotional Products Decorators" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/industries/promotional-products-decorators/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>DECORATORS</small><h3>Promotional Products Decorators</h3><p>Connect artwork decisions, production stages and fulfillment into a more visible workflow.</p><a href="/industries/promotional-products-decorators/">Decorator solutions →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="gp-section alt"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-split"><div><h2>What this page will cover</h2></div><div class="gp-list"><div>Company stores and client reorder programs.</div><div>SAGE and supplier product-data workflows.</div><div>PunchOut and enterprise procurement.</div><div>Artwork approvals, production and fulfillment.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow that does not fit off-the-shelf software?</h2><p>Show us the current process. We can help identify the simplest Shopify, integration, or automation approach before you commit to a larger build.</p></div><a class="gp-btn" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a></div><p class="gp-note">This page is connected and launch-ready. Detailed sales copy, proof, screenshots and SEO depth can be expanded in the next content pass.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
